VBoy Color by yuk27 and contributors. GNU GPL version 3.
https://github.com/yuk27/VBoyColor
Imported revision 528297b2c7f8d116277e776dead69caa4d50663b.
VBoy Color started as a fork of VirtualBoyGo by CidVonHighwind (Patrick) and contributors,
GNU GPL version 3; its tile tracking and color pack format are part of the core here.
https://github.com/CidVonHighwind/VirtualBoyGo
Menu logo adapted from the VBoyColor project's original artwork (Juan's, per VBoy Color's notices):
https://github.com/yuk27/VBoyColor/blob/main/assets/logo/vboycolor-logo.png
Cropped and resized, with a beveled GX badge added. The Homebrew Channel icon (hbc/icon.png)
uses the same logo pieces arranged in one row.
Beetle VB revision 38e7a0ec9ac7079ca1c1e3dd9aaf5b56f527efca; GPL version 2 or later.
The license texts for everything in this file are in the licenses folder shipped with the app
(GPL-3.txt, beetle-vb-GPL-2.txt and one file per library below; in the source, licenses/).

CRC-matched Virtual Boy idle-loop handling adapted from Mednafen/WiiMednafen,
by Ryphecha and contributors. GNU GPL version 2 or later.
