Menu music:
The menu music is this retro synthwave loop by user abelouis on Looperman:
https://www.looperman.com/loops/detail/247262/bells-melody-retro-synthwave-35b-abelouis-free-96bpm-ambient-pad-loop
("Bells Melody Retro SynthWave 35B"; raised 6.6 dB and encoded as Ogg Vorbis at 32 kHz.)

